  "finding": "In published Bluent Release WASM and pinned Fluent Web Components, the computed font stacks match, as do 14px font size, weight 600, 20px line-height, 12px inline padding and canvas text advance width (57.72 CSS px for Continue). The Debug host alone overrides --fontFamilyBase to Tahoma; that run has a 63.23px canvas advance and is retained separately only to document why the initial Debug comparison was not a valid release parity baseline. The Release screenshot foreground glyph mask overlaps the Fluent mask at IoU 1.000 in Light/LTR and greater than 0.99 in Dark/RTL; color-surface differences remain measurable in the pixel diff. This is runtime evidence only, not a design approval.",
